sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant SPA as React SPA
  participant API as Express API
  participant SDK as Strands SDK
  participant V as Vendor Sandbox
  participant ST as JSON Store
  participant B as Bedrock model (live)
  participant E as SSE channel

  U->>SPA: Open dashboard — 14 subscriptions · $47,400/yr
  SPA->>API: POST /api/demo/run { mode }
  API->>SDK: runGuardian (candidate set · triggers)
  SDK->>ST: Read policy + cached evidence
  SDK->>B: Reason via Bedrock (live mode only)
  SDK->>SDK: Validate GuardianOutputSchema
  SDK-->>API: Decision packages
  API->>ST: Persist decision cards
  API->>E: Emit guardian_progress
  E-->>SPA: Stream events
  SPA-->>U: Cards — Notion NEGOTIATE · Loom SWITCH
  U->>SPA: Approve NEGOTIATE card
  Note over API,SDK: Human gate — nothing contacts a vendor until approval
  SPA->>API: POST /api/decisions/:id/approve
  API->>SDK: runNegotiation (approved card only)
  loop ≤ 5 rounds
    SDK->>V: propose offer
    V-->>SDK: counter offer
  end
  SDK->>ST: Persist accepted negotiation
  API->>ST: Apply mutation — renewal $9,840
  API->>E: Emit resolved state
  E-->>SPA: Stream events
  SPA-->>U: Savings → $5,760/yr